  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>From dominating the paint to winning MVP titles, A'ja Wilson's journey is one of unstoppable power and dedication‚ÄîBring that same strength to your game with the Nike A'Ja. Inspired by the unstoppable force that is A'ja Wilson, these shoes are built to fuel your game at every level. The plush Cushlon 3.0 foam delivers unmatched comfort, giving you the energy return you need to stay fresh and relentless from tip-off to buzzer. The extended heel bump provides extra stability to help you explode when it matters the most. Topped off with A'ja's bold, strong, and playful logo, these signature shoes are an ultimate reminder to be unapologetic on the court. Give your best performance every single time and show the world what you're made of with the Nike A'Ja.</p> <p><strong>Nike A'Ja</strong><strong> features: </strong></p> <ul> <li>Light and breathable mesh offers comfort.</li> <li>Midfoot band provides optimal arch support and movement control.</li> <li>Soft, stable foam combined with a generative micro-tuned traction pattern adds support.</li> </ul> <span>*The Nike A'One is now available in men's sizes. For women, order 1.5 sizes down. Example: Women's 10.5 = Men's 9.</span><hr /><p>When the game speeds up, this signature pair helps you stay confident from first cut to final bucket. Built for A'ja Wilson's all-around style, the Nike A'One pairs plush Cushlon 3.0 foam with breathable support and a stable heel design so you can move comfortably and play with purpose.</p><ul><li>Light, breathable mesh upper for airflow and a comfortable feel</li><li>Cushlon 3.0 foam for plush cushioning and lasting comfort</li><li>Midfoot band for arch support and movement control</li><li>Generative micro-tuned traction pattern and extended heel design for grip and stability</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p><p>For the best fit, most reviewers recommend going up half a size, especially if you like a little extra room through the forefoot. The overall feel is sleek and close to the foot, so players with wider feet may prefer a roomier basketball fit, while some narrow-footed wearers enjoy the locked-in shape.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p><p>Best for indoor players who want strong traction, lightweight cushioning, and a snug, court-ready feel that can also carry off the hardwood.</p>  <p><strong>Court Feel &amp; Traction</strong></p><p>Reviewers consistently call out the grip as a standout, with confident bite for quick stops, cuts, and changes of direction. The supportive, low-profile ride helps keep you connected to the floor, and the outsole performs best when kept clean on dusty courts.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p><p>Some players say the upper and collar feel better after a few sessions, settling into a more natural fit as the shoe breaks in. Once dialed in, the platform is appreciated for its stable feel, though glossy logo details may show cosmetic scuffs with heavy use.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p><p>For best traction, give the outsole a quick wipe during dusty runs. If you're wearing them often on and off the court, be mindful of abrasive surfaces to help keep the finish looking fresh.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike A'One - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Sequoia/Volt/Cargo Khaki</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-w